        <mxCell id="i55__2" value="The top module is structural. HyperBus control and the PHY run on CLK-CORE (2 x CK); the AXI4 interface runs on CLK-AXI, the same clock as CLK-CORE or an asynchronous one behind the AXI crossing; APB4 is asynchronous on CLK-APB. DQ and RWDS cross the top boundary as separate input, output and active-high OE signals; the SoC pad wrapper maps them to the pads and provides the delay line of the read capture." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;fontSize=18;fontColor=#000000;spacing=2;" vertex="1" parent="1" vlsit_library_sha256="D1631ACF98A920526B235E8970FEDDC9305EA2F0D6A35C6529CD220D62AFABB6" vlsit_library_entry="0" vlsit_library_cell="2" vlsit_library_instance="i55">
